MACRO PREF                                                                      
  &PREF.WXTR3C                                            1    15 A             
*                                 PRIMARY EXTRACT                               
*                                                                               
*                                 PRICE KONV FACTORS FROM                       
*                                 THE FUNCTIONGROUP REGISTER                    
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
    &PREF.IDKONCNR                                        1     2 P  0          
*                                 CONCERN NO                                    
    &PREF.KDCLAGER                                        3     1 P  0          
*                                 CENTRAL WAREHOUSE CODE                        
    &PREF.IDFKNGRP                                        4     3 P  0          
*                                 FUNCTION GROUP                                
    &PREF.KDPRODSL                                        7     2 P  0          
*                                 PRODUCT GROUP                                 
    &PREF.KDPRTILL                                        9     1 P  0          
*                                 PRICE ADAPTION CODE                           
    &PREF.REOMRTAL-MX                                    10     3 P  3          
*                                 PR CONV FAC F.GR BO                           
    &PREF.REOMRTAL-DX                                    13     3 P  3          
*                                 PR CONV F GR DO                               
*** END COPY WXTR3C                  LENGTH =            15                     
